## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a practical online ICA pipeline for few channels, plus a robust fault-tolerance strategy and a concrete evaluation plan.

## Key Concepts
- Online convolutional ICA for 3 channels
- Time-domain whitening with a forgetting factor
- 2x2 demixer and fault-tolerance reinitialization
- Cross-frame permutation tracking under channel drop
- Realistic CPU constraints and latency targets

## Code Example
